---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<Layout title="Financial Support – Apon UK" description="Financial Support by Apon">
  <PageHeader title="Financial Support by Apon" subtitle="" actions={[{label:'Apon Portal',href:'https://portal.apon.uk/',primary:true}]} />
  <section class="section white"><article class="container prose">
    <p>At Apon, we believe finances should never be a barrier to personal or professional growth. That’s why we offer multiple financial support options—whether you’re enrolling in training, planning to study abroad, or building your career. We partner with trusted institutions to make the process smooth, secure, and student-friendly</p>
    <section><h2>Training Program Support:</h2><p>We offer partial or full financial assistance for selected training programs available through Apon. This includes digital skills, freelancing, language preparation (like IELTS), and career-specific certifications. Our goal is to ensure you can access the learning you need—regardless of your financial background</p></section>
    <section><h2>Student Loan Assistance</h2><p>For those planning to pursue higher education locally or abroad, we help facilitate student loans through our verified partner banks</p><p><strong>How the Process Works:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Register & Login</strong><br/>Sign up on the Apon Portal and log in to your dashboard.</li><li><strong>Submit Documents</strong><br/>Upload all required documents—these must be original, authentic, and verifiable.</li><li><strong>We Forward to Partner Bank</strong><br/>Our team will review your submission and send it to the relevant partner bank.</li><li><strong>Bank Will Respond</strong><br/>The bank will provide a checklist of any additional documents or steps needed.</li><li><strong>Proceed with Application</strong><br/>Once verified, you’ll continue with the official student loan process guided by the bank.</li></ol><p><strong>Important Notes:</strong></p><ul><li>All documents must be real, valid, and issued by recognized authorities</li><li>Any attempt to submit false or altered documents will result in disqualification</li><li>Loan approval depends on your academic plan, financial need, and the bank’s internal review</li></ul></section>
  </article></section>
</Layout>
